    "created_at": "2016-09-16T22:43:26Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-16T22:43:26Z",
    "body": "I think the text as presently written is misleading and suggest a minor modification..\n\n```\nA settings object\n    Is an environment settings object, containing various \n    settings that are shared with other scripts in the same context.\n```\n",
