    "created_at": "2016-09-16T22:53:50Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-09-16T22:53:50Z",
    "body": "That doesn't fit with the style of the spec though. The \"is\" is implied in all `<dl>`s throughout the spec; the left-hand side is the term, and the right-hand indented side is the definition.\n",
